#, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Now remove some tests triggering a full rebuild of the Rust standard library"
#~ " and compiler, remove a special case for supporting the "
#~ "<command>cargo</command> test suite (that we don't run because it's expected"
#~ " to be running in a Rustc git repository) but triggering a rebuild of "
#~ "<command>cargo</command> when running <command>python3 x.py "
#~ "install</command>, and prevent building one component useless for BLFS:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Agora remova alguns testes que deflagram uma reconstrução completa da "
#~ "biblioteca padrão e do compilador Rust, remova um caso especial para suporte"
#~ " para a suíte de teste do <command>cargo</command> (aquele que nós não "
#~ "executamos porque é esperado que esteja executando em um repositório git "
#~ "Rustc), mas deflagrante de uma reconstrução do <command>cargo</command> ao "
#~ "executar <command>python3 x.py install</command> e evite construir um "
#~ "componente inútil para BLFS:"

#, no-wrap, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "<userinput>sed '/MirOpt/d' -i src/bootstrap/src/core/builder.rs &amp;&amp;\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "sed 's/!path.ends_with(\"cargo\")/true/' \\\n"
#~ "    -i src/bootstrap/src/core/build_steps/tool.rs &amp;&amp;\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "sed 's/^.*build_wasm.*$/#[allow(unreachable_code)]&amp;return false;/' \\\n"
#~ "    -i src/bootstrap/src/lib.rs</userinput>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<userinput>sed '/MirOpt/d' -i src/bootstrap/src/core/builder.rs &amp;&amp;\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "sed 's/!path.ends_with(\"cargo\")/true/' \\\n"
#~ "    -i src/bootstrap/src/core/build_steps/tool.rs &amp;&amp;\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "sed 's/^.*build_wasm.*$/#[allow(unreachable_code)]&amp;return false;/' \\\n"
#~ "    -i src/bootstrap/src/lib.rs</userinput>"

#, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Four tests in the <filename class='directory'>tests/run-make</filename> "
#~ "directory are known to fail because they need targets not enabled in the "
#~ "BLFS <xref linkend='llvm'/> configuration (nor the "
#~ "<literal>llvm.targets</literal> in <filename>config.toml</filename>, in case"
#~ " building with the shipped LLVM).  One test named "
#~ "<literal>core::config::tests::download_ci_llvm</literal> is known to fail.  "
#~ "And, one test named <filename>121444.rs</filename> is known to fail with "
#~ "LLVM 19.1 or newer because a crash is fixed with the new LLVM but the Rustc "
#~ "test harness does not have the concept of unexpected passes."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Quatro testes no diretório <filename class='directory'>tests/run-"
#~ "make</filename> são conhecidos por falharem porque precisam de alvos não "
#~ "habilitados na configuração do <xref linkend='llvm'/> do BLFS (nem o "
#~ "<literal>llvm.targets</literal> em <filename>config.toml</filename>, no caso"
#~ " de construção com o LLVM enviado). Um teste chamado "
#~ "<literal>core::config::tests::download_ci_llvm</literal> é conhecido por "
#~ "falhar. E um teste chamado <filename>121444.rs</filename> é conhecido por "
#~ "falhar com LLVM 19.1 ou mais recente porque uma falha é corrigida com o novo"
#~ " LLVM, mas o conjunto de testes do Rustc não tem o conceito de aprovações "
#~ "inesperadas."

